{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日 たのしい(*^_^*) ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ、かずみん、かなりん、あすか、なーちゃん、わたし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にぎやかですっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっはー／(^o^)＼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、新しくめがねを\n２つ買いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで、さゆめがね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５つになります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな種類もってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それもその、目がすごく悪くて\n普段はずっとめがねでして、\nめがねがないと\n何も見えないんです( ^ω^ ；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パソコンやり過ぎたよおヽ(；▽；)ノ\n小学生の頃からめがねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもでも、\nめがねってよいよね( ^ω^ )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかよい！ すき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいめがねをかけると、なんか\n嬉しい気持ちになります(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなは、めがね女子 すき？ **"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キリッと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、こないだこれに制服着てたら\nさゆにゃん、給食食べるの遅い図書委員長にしか見えないー( ^^ )\nって、れいかたんに言われてね、\nそれが本当にその通りだったので\nずばり当てられてびっくりしました(*_*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだったよ(°_°)！図書委員長だった！！\nって言ったら、れいかたんも\nびっくりして お互いびっくりして\nははーってなったよ("},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"￣▽￣"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")照れ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかしそんな絵に描いたようにわかりやすいわたしって／(^o^)＼笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、今日もいい日だったなあ！\n周りに感謝してっ(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさゆにゃんっ ☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/9533010/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}